{"at":"2026-11-26 18:54","message":"Everything else in 01-setup is done (repo pushed, app scaffolded, realtime works, 20/20 iTunes previews OK). One fix needed: SUPABASE_DB_URL in .env is malformed; it is missing the 'postgresql://postgres:' start, so it begins with the password. 1) Open the Supabase dashboard > your project > Connect > 'Direct connection' (or 'Session pooler' if your network has no IPv6) and copy the full URI, which looks like postgresql://postgres:[YOUR-PASSWORD]@db.<ref>.supabase.co:5432/postgres. 2) Replace [YOUR-PASSWORD] with your database password; if it contains characters like + $ @ / # ?, URL-encode them (+ is %2B, $ is %24, @ is %40) or reset the password in Project Settings > Database to a simple letters-and-digits one. 3) Put the whole string on the SUPABASE_DB_URL line of .env with no spaces or trailing comment. 4) Run: node tools/smoke-realtime.mjs  (expect 4 passed), then re-run the driver: node run_phases.mjs. Note: the database password was accidentally printed in an agent log while debugging, so resetting it (Project Settings > Database) is recommended, then use the new one."}